Both, although it is not yet in 2.5.

If you run openvpn.exe from that installation, you should see:

  C:\Program Files\OpenVPN\bin>openvpn.exe
  <...>
  Windows Specific:
  <...>
  --windows-driver   : Which tun driver to use?
